	"Description": "Editor AI toolsets that expose WorldBLD, CityBLD, RoadBLD and TwinBLD to agents through the Toolset Registry and Unreal MCP server: session context and packaging troubleshooting, city inspection and editing, road network authoring, and real-world replica import.",
